Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:00:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] AROS: find language servers in the Helix drawer

A bare command that is not on the path is also looked up in the drawer
named by HELIX_PROGDIR, which the hx launcher sets to its own drawer.
wat_server installed next to Helix then starts with Helix's default
configuration, without a path in ENVARC:helix/languages.toml.

names_a_path() tells a command given by its path from a name to search
for; ExecutableNotFoundError::command() gives the command as configured.
Host tests cover the fallback and the path test.
